      "markdown": "# Typed array objects\n\nEach row is a single array object with its own indexed cells.\n\n**Numbers** retain their numeric values. **Characters** display one Unicode code point; a space is shown as ␠. **Strings** keep quotation marks, so an empty string is distinct from **null**, shown as ∅. **Booleans** display true or false. A **mixed** row preserves the underlying type of each primitive value.\n\nArrays accept literal values or per-cell value expressions. Highlight expressions bind independently to state; no marker or other visual object is referenced. Nested arrays and object/reference cells are not part of this initial renderer.",
